@startuml
title Logical Peripheral Transaction
participant "CPU/platform" as CPU
participant "Interface adapter" as IF
participant "Address decoder" as DEC
participant "Selected device" as DEV
CPU -> IF: address and operation
IF -> DEC: logical transaction
DEC -> DEC: decode one target
DEC -> DEV: select/handshake
DEV --> IF: data/completion
IF --> CPU: return data/completion
DEC -> DEV: release select
@enduml